%% A linked-event GET route, for example /api/events/{eventId}/room-nights-pickup?evtstub=...
%% Source: src/app/api/events/[eventId]/*/route.ts, src/lib/checkLinkedPasskeyEventAccess.ts,
%% src/lib/route-utils.ts:82-92. Verified at commit 61e748e.
sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client hook
  participant M as middleware.ts
  participant R as Route handler
  participant G as checkLinkedPasskeyEventAccess
  participant D as Data module
  participant U as Upstream service
  C->>M: GET with evtstub and filters
  M->>R: authenticated request
  R->>R: getAuthContext isLoggedIn, else 401
  R->>R: Zod safeParse params, else 400
  R->>G: guard(evtstub, eventId)
  G->>G: checkCoreEventAccess (cached 1 h)
  G->>G: getLinkedPasskeyEventId equals eventId, else 403
  R->>D: get ViewModel
  D->>U: parallel calls with chosen token
  U-->>D: JSON
  D->>D: parse upstream schema, map, parse ViewModel
  D-->>R: ViewModel
  R-->>C: 200 JSON
  Note over R: Errors go to handleRouteError: 401/403/404/409 pass through, other ServiceError 502, unknown 500
